'''Only one of us leaves!''' (いきてはかえさん！, ''Ikite wa Kaesan！'', '''Go and Get It!''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Update 15.6]].

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (Sm): Wallet starts with 300¢.

